  <!-- EN: Dreamt about abstract shapes -->
  <DreamAbstractShapes.label>梦见了抽象的形状</DreamAbstractShapes.label>
  <!-- EN: I saw many abstract shapes that were floating around me like planets. I thought the shapes were my family and friends. At some point a foreign shape appeared consuming my close ones and thus growing bigger. At the end it got me too... -->
  <DreamAbstractShapes.description>我看到许多抽象的形状像行星一样在我周围漂浮。我以为那些形状就是我的家人和朋友。不知何时，一个陌生的形状出现了，它吞噬了我的亲人，从而变得越来越大。最后，它也吞噬了我……</DreamAbstractShapes.description>
