  <!-- EN: Dreamt about darkness -->
  <DreamDarknessEverywhere.label>梦见了黑暗</DreamDarknessEverywhere.label>
  <!-- EN: There was darkness all around me... There was light somewhere but I didn't know where, so I searched for it. Without the light there was no hope... -->
