  <!-- EN: Dreamt about furniture -->
  <DreamFurnitureFight.label>梦见了家具</DreamFurnitureFight.label>
  <!-- EN: All of the furniture pieces around me started to grow and at some point they were as tall as old buildings in books. I knew they were evil... I had to fight them! -->
  <DreamFurnitureFight.description>我周围的所有家具都开始生长，不知不觉间，它们已经长得和书里描绘的古老建筑一样高了。我知道它们是邪恶的……我必须与它们战斗！</DreamFurnitureFight.description>
