  <!-- EN: Dreamt about redhead with beard -->
  <DreamRedheadWithBeard.label>梦见了一个留着胡子的红发人</DreamRedheadWithBeard.label>
  <!-- EN: It started off at school, where I began to realize something was wrong. Everyone I saw looked like they could barely contain themselves from instantly becoming violent, and they had this look in their eyes like they had just spotted the best prey they had ever seen, but were held back by something. I remember thinking "No way, I'm out", and ran home as fast as I could. Some of it is blurry, but I remember coming across people that I knew, either friends or family, or people from the neighborhood, telling me to get home, that it's not safe. Finally I make it there, put the key in the front door, open it, and I am literally surrounded by all of those same people, only now they look like the ones at school, and there stands the redhead with the beard. Without saying a word she lunges at me and pierces my neck with her fangs. -->
  <DreamRedheadWithBeard.description>事情始于学校，在那里我开始意识到有些不对劲。我看到的每个人看起来都仿佛正竭力克制着自己，生怕瞬间爆发暴力，他们的眼神里透着一种仿佛刚发现有生以来最完美的猎物，却又被某种力量束缚住的感觉。 我记得当时心想：“不可能，我得赶紧离开”，于是以最快的速度跑回家。虽然部分记忆有些模糊，但我记得途中遇到了些熟人——无论是朋友、家人还是邻居——他们都告诉我赶紧回家，说外面不安全。 终于到了家，我把钥匙插进前门，一开门，就发现自己被那些同样的人团团围住——只不过此刻他们看起来和学校里的人一模一样，而那个留着胡子的红发女人就站在那里。她二话不说就扑向我，用獠牙刺穿了我的脖子。</DreamRedheadWithBeard.description>
  <DreamRedheadWithBeard.stages.NoLabel.label>NoLabel</DreamRedheadWithBeard.stages.NoLabel.label>
  <DreamRedheadWithBeard.stages.NoLabel.description>无描述</DreamRedheadWithBeard.stages.NoLabel.description>
  <!-- EN: Dreamt about strange steps -->
  <DreamStrangeSteps.label>梦见了奇怪的台阶</DreamStrangeSteps.label>
  <!-- EN: I dreamt about a strange cavern with hundreds of steps. I knew some other world existed down there but it was too far for me to reach. With each step I took towards it the cavern got smaller and smaller. At some point it disappeared... and I was all alone in the dark. -->
  <DreamStrangeSteps.description>我梦见了一个有数百级台阶的奇异洞穴。我知道那里下方存在着另一个世界，但距离太远，我无法抵达。随着我朝它迈出每一步，洞穴变得越来越小。不知何时，它消失了……而我独自一人置身于黑暗之中。</DreamStrangeSteps.description>
